WEBVTT

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.970
Sorry. I'll head home.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.890
Senpai, wai--

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.100
Miyano-senpai?

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.770
I won't be long. Please wait for me!

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.860
With the seniors gone
at the end of the year...

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:37.030
Sorry! Tell me tomorrow!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.370
That's fine, I guess.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.250
The new Vice Chairman
immediately skipped out.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:47.420
You don't normally see
Miyano-senpai run in the halls.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.840
Not exactly a model
Discipline Committee member, huh?

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:15.570
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:29.100
"Episode 12: 'Just Beginning'"

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.190
"Episode 12: 'Just Beginning'"

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.190
Sasaki-senpai!

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.020
He's not here...

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.860
He left?

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.530
Is he at the entrance?

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:45.450
I think he misunderstood.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.250
Sorry.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.670
Don't leave.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.130
You misunderstood.

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:00.340
I wasn't...

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.140
I...

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:09.680
I was fine with him kissing me!

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.980
What's up?

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.900
Hanzawa-senpai. Hirano-senpai.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.200
Um, have you seen Sasaki-senpai?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.150
Have <i>you</i>?

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.200
Nope.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.370
That's a lot of racket.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.920
Looks like he left.
Only his jacket is here.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:33.790
Have you called him?

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.550
Um, well, I don't have his number...

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.920
You <i>still </i>don't have each other's number?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.800
S-Sorry.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.310
Calm down.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.850
I-I'll try.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:52.810
"Fully Explained"
"Frequently Tested English Grammar"
"With Examples"

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.230
You're dating Sasaki, right?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.730
What?!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:00.320
W-We aren't dating...

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.860
You aren't?!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:08.030
We aren't <i>dating</i>, but...

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.490
You like him.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.830
Yes.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.710
It can be tough having
a same-sex relationship.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.880
Some people make all sorts of comments.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.630
Are you speaking from experience?

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.100
Not mine, but my family's.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.520
In my family's case, it was guys,

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:35.100
so it was scary when
I happened upon them fighting.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.400
And if I saw an injury, I'd worry
something had happened with the boyfriend.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.650
--I don't think you two
would fight like that, though.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.740
--So you see...
--I totally get it.
--I don't think you two
would fight like that, though.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.030
I haven't said anything yet.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:51.620
And people will ask things they'd
never ask an opposite-sex couple.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:58.380
I guess they can't help but focus on it,
even if it's irrelevant to the discussion.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.250
What I'm getting at is,

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:04.420
I'm a little worried you two
will have to face stuff like that.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.890
Even if someone does say something,

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:14.890
I believe I can handle it
if Sasaki-senpai is with me.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:24.030
Which is why I want to do
my best not to make him worry--

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.490
You can laugh.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:28.910
I won't.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.830
Your lovey-dovey talk is sweet.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.700
L-Lovey-dovey talk?!
That's not what I was doing...

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.290
What's with the racket?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.120
Oh, did he pick up?

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.380
No answer.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.250
Maybe he's on the train.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.420
That or helping his family.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.960
Helping his family?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.760
Sasaki's family runs a bakery, apparently.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.050
A bakery...

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.430
Oh.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.270
Excuse me. I have an idea, so I'm leaving.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.100
Huh?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.600
Thank you so much.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.490
Think it'll work out?

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:11.200
Sasaki, you forgot stuff at school.
Get your butt back here.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.200
He answered?

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:13.580
I left a message.

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.790
What did he leave here?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.830
I lied.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.210
This way, he'll run into Miyano.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.300
Hopefully they don't miss each other.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.800
If he misses Miyano and
comes here, I can smack him.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:34.810
Hey, the library has old exams. Wanna see
who scores higher while we wait?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:35.930
Sure.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:04.460
We're not even dating
and I tried to kiss him.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.380
That's not okay to do on impulse.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.680
I remember which station he gets off at.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.850
We rode together a ton
during the exam period.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:25.270
I was basically forcing him.

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:29.610
Miyano's a guy, but I'm stronger than him.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:42.420
What do you think
it means to like someone?

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.710
For instance, wanting
to do things for them.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:49.170
I want to take care of you, Senpai.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:52.970
There are tons of things
I want to do for him.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:00.310
I told him I'd wait,
but my restraint keeps slipping...

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.350
I should probably distance
myself from him, but...

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.190
...that would be even harder.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.860
I need to apologize fully tomorrow.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.670
Senpai.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:33.300
That's the right station for
the bakery. He said it's his house.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.800
Thanks.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:41.850
He cares about what I like.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:44.810
I wanna read something <i>you </i>like.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.690
I really liked that story.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.730
I think BL is what
made this story possible.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.450
I saw the next volume, so I bought it.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:57.910
And I... I...

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:03.000
I also want to kiss him, too.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.170
--Senpai's house should be this w--

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.880
--Mya-chan?
--Senpai's house should be this w--

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.430
Senpai.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.470
Are you going somewhere?

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.690
Um, could we talk a little first?

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:31.520
I was told I forgot stuff at school,
so I was heading back. Why are you...

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.400
I came to see you.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.530
Let's find a place to talk.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:10:00.220
It started with admiration.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.410
Um, Senpai, I...

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:26.540
Wait.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:35.170
First let me say sorry...
for earlier today.

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:40.340
We're not going out, and I was forceful.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:44.930
I meant to wait until
you answered before...

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.770
...I'm really sorry.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.150
Senpai, I like you.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.740
Again.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:08.040
"Again?" What, my confession?

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:19.010
I like you, Sasaki-senpai!

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.980
A-Are you okay?

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:36.190
Sorry. No, I mean, you can think
about it some more. No rush.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.440
More?

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.860
But I've had quite a lot of time.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:43.450
You.. have? Oh, yeah.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:48.080
The time with you flew by, so...

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:51.620
I also like being with you, Senpai.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.880
A-Are you sure about what you're saying?

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.880
I-I believe I am.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.010
I was just surprised earlier, is all.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:08.220
I happened to bump my hand into you.
Um... I wasn't telling you no...

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.890
Calm down.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:16.440
Take a breath.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:21.440
The things that happened that day, and
the time we spent talking on the train...

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.660
I really liked it.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.120
Um...

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.700
Your support during the
cultural festival made me happy...

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:34.370
And after the movie,
you treated me like normal...

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.960
You made me feel so relieved...

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:42.260
I feel like words aren't
enough to get this across.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:49.260
But he won't know if I don't tell him!

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:53.520
Uh, when I say I enjoy being around you,
it's not just that I admire you.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.400
I...

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:59.570
I f-found you cute!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.490
Uh, I...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.660
U-Um, I mean,

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:09.330
I think you're cool!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.540
I got the order backwards!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:17.960
I wanted to become brave like you,

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.380
and after we started talking,

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:26.300
you showed me how wonderful it is to have
someone take an interest in what I like.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:33.770
I enjoy finding out what you like,
and talking to you puts me at ease.

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:37.230
But it's more than that...

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:42.610
Sometimes I want to hug you...

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:43.820
This is frustrating.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.990
It makes me happy to see you smile...

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:53.290
And I... want to touch you.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.630
Senpai.

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:01.130
How?

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:05.420
Doesn't this mean we feel
the same way about each other?

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.560
How can I get my feelings across to him?

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.140
The same?

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:20.400
Mya-chan, your hand is cold.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:30.570
Your hand is cold, too, Senpai.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.080
Yeah...

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.170
Can I hug you?

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.580
Y-Yes, by all means!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:47.380
I'm sorry. But "by all means..."
That's too cute.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.800
Y-You're cute, too!

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.890
<i>That's </i>your reaction?

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.710
Then... is kissing okay?

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:29.720
With you... I want to.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:35.120
You're okay with this?

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.030
Yes. I want to.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:44.120
Sorry. Your heartbeat's super loud.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:46.840
D-Don't listen to it!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:51.210
I've never done this before.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.510
Yeah.

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:59.260
My heart is going crazy, too.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.520
It is.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.160
I don't wanna graduate.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:18.320
Please do graduate.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:23.410
It keeps getting more and more real.
School is almost over.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:26.460
Oh, school! The stuff you forgot.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:29.170
Right. Hirano left a message...

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.760
It doesn't matter.
He probably lied anyway.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:38.010
Would Hirano-senpai lie like that?

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.220
I'm not sure he would lie like that.
Though he sometimes spouts nonsense.

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.560
Wanna call him?

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.770
Huh? Sure...

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.690
Here, Mya-chan. You talk to him.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.440
What?!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.110
Like this?

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.780
H-Hello?

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.030
Huh? Miyano?

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:58.490
Um, Sasaki-senpai can't
come to the phone right now...

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:05.500
Oh, I was mistaken about his stuff.
Tell him for me. Bye.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.670
Time to go.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.170
Okay.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.670
"Fully Explained"
"Frequently Tested English Grammar"
"With Examples"

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.670
Okay.

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:11.250
"Fully Explained"
"Frequently Tested English Grammar"
"With Examples"

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:11.250
Looks like this is a draw.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.840
What'd he say?

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.760
He was mistaken.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.180
Of course he was.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.220
Did he say that so
we'd run into each other?

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.470
I mean, forgetting something...

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.480
Ah!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.940
Sasaki-senpai, I like you.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.360
Be my boyfriend!

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.360
What's with the sudden formality?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.400
In a BL manga I read,

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.910
volume 2 ended with them
saying they liked each other,

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:40.530
but in volume 3 they still weren't dating.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.700
It was distressing.
I don't want that to happen.

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:48.290
Senpai, don't laugh...

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.920
Sorry. Sorry.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.210
Thanks.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.380
What's got you so cracked up?

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:57.550
Okay.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.760
Hey, Mya-chan.

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.720
Wanna go out?

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.770
Goodness.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.850
You're so cute, Mya-chan.

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.440
Wanna go out?

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.610
Yes!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:22.410
This is our story.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.830
Oh, yeah. Almost forgot again.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:32.420
Whenever something happened,
I could just have Hirano contact you.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:35.550
We can't always bother him.

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.420
My number's 080--

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.380
H-Hold on!

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:46.770
And it's just beginning.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.410
What is it?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.160
I'll tell you later.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.700
Morning.

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:33.750
Congrats.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:35.210
Can I tell my girlfriend?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:36.790
I-I don't want you to.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.290
So you're not saying I can't.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:41.130
Congrats for what?

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:43.840
Let's go to the bathroom.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.180
Really? But I don't need to.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.760
Just come with me. Come on.

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:49.510
Wait, me, too?

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:51.180
I'm pooped.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.850
We're here to study.
Don't take on odd tasks.

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:59.690
It's basically a stretch break.
Aren't you stiff? You need to move around.

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:01.150
For real?

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:07.700
Hirano.

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.320
We're dating.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.450
This isn't the bathroom.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:14.120
Don't worry about that.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:19.500
Tashiro, remember how you asked
if Miyano and Sasaki were dating?

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.210
Yeah. But I was wrong.

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:24.510
It's easier just to share now.

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:29.010
Okay, yeah, but I wasn't ready...

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:33.060
Um, well... we started going out.

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:34.560
What? Really?

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:36.230
So I was right.

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:37.690
Yeah, yeah.

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:39.650
Oh...

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:41.360
That's great...

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:42.520
Yeah.

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:45.110
Dammit. Look, I'm not great at this.

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:47.950
I know.

00:22:47.950 --> 00:22:50.910
By the way, exchange numbers already.

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:52.240
We did. Yesterday.

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:55.160
Finally! What the hell took so long?

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:57.290
No kidding.

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:59.870
But it's great it worked out.

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:01.080
Were you listening?

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:02.840
I overheard.

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:04.420
What's great?

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:07.170
Oh. We'll tell you later.

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:09.300
'Scuse me?

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.760
Oh, crap! I'm gonna be late for class!

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:15.060
Tashiro, no running in the halls.

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:17.430
That's our Discipline Vice Chairman.

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:19.390
Oh, hey, Mya-chan.

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:21.940
Oh, S-Sasaki-senpai!

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:25.110
G-Good morning!

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:27.900
Morning. Study hard today.

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:33.700
I will! Good luck studying for
entrance exams. I'm rooting for you!

